      hash: "sha256:b37a9b37f21bbba397c7aa5daf0f8e95b27e2cdc684812c03a6bb9d8f60a22aa"
outcomeRecord: "---\nslug: portable-skill-installation\nshipped: 2026-09-25\nschemaVersion: 1\n---\n# portable-skill-installation\n\nExternal skills install through tracked ownership and vendor adapters with bounded safety and rollback behavior.\nOriginal source decisions, contradictions and verification limits are retained in the linked supplement.\nThis legacy upgrade makes no new execution or live-quality claim.\n\n- outcome: External skills install through tracked ownership and vendor adapters with bounded safety and rollback behavior.\n- docs: [source supplement](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-installation.md)\n- decisions: [retained decisions](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-installation.md)\n- knowledge: [lessons and constraints](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-installation.md)\n- code: none\n- verification: [historical verification](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-installation.md)\n- followups: [retained limits](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-installation.md), [backlog](.project/pitches/_followups.md)\n- archive: [reviewed recovery record](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/portable-skill-installation.md)\n"
